category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6 python312
sdesc: "Software framework for scalable cross-language services development (python bindings)"
ldesc: "The Apache Thrift software framework, for scalable cross-language services
development, combines a software stack with a code generation engine to build
services that work efficiently and seamlessly between C++, Java, Python, PHP,
Ruby, Erlang, Perl, Haskell, C#, Cocoa, JavaScript, Node.js, Smalltalk, OCaml
and Delphi and other languages."
external-source: thrift

